constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}
1 ≤ arr[i] ≤ 10^{3}

expected time complexity: O(N*LOG(N)).
expected auxiliary space: O(N).

standard_solution_code:
def reaching_height(n, arr):
	arr.sort()
	lst = []
	if arr.count(arr[0]) == n and n > 1:
		return [-1]
	else:
		for i in range(0, n // 2):
			x = i + 1
			lst.extend([arr[-x], arr[i]])
		if n % 2 != 0:
			lst.append(arr[n // 2])
		return lst
